  message: "OPERATOR-SURFACED — fresh reproduction on a wont_do item; may warrant operator review. Dogfood tranche 05 facet (F83.A3 / anon-card-019): refines the linker zero-emit observation with the node-vs-edge asymmetry. 671/34396 nodes (1.95%) participate in ZERO edges. subprocess-linker emits 78 synthetic nodes / 78 orphans (100%); graphql-resolver-linker 11/11 orphaned; ALL 113 synthetic call_site nodes are orphans. dispatches_to edges come only from decorator-dispatch/type-hierarchy/rust-trait, never subprocess-linker. Of the 113 orphaned call_site nodes: subprocess-linker 78 + http-linker 18 + database-query-linker 17. http-linker is a THIRD call_site orphan-producer (emits client-HTTP-call nodes like 'GET /api/users' but never connects them to a route/handler), not previously named alongside subprocess/graphql; database-query-linker is the only call_site producer that connects any nodes (17/34, via references edges). websocket-linker (30 nodes) by contrast DOES wire edges (0 orphans). These synthetic symbols inflate node/symbol/search counts and supply-chain tier tallies while contributing nothing to the call graph. Evidence: frozen substrate.json (probe_1_orphans.log, probe_1_subproc.log). Blind severity 3/5, reproduced on frozen substrate. NOT auto-reopened (item is wont_do) — surfacing to operator for review only."  # 7f2e
